# Avelo environment configuration (no secrets committed here).
#
# The app is fully runnable with NO environment variables set at all --
# it uses a deterministic, non-AI fallback for voice-field extraction and
# in-memory demo data by default.
#
# To enable a REAL LLM-backed voice extractor instead of the deterministic
# fallback, implement a VoiceExtractionAdapter (see
# src/domain/voiceExtractionAdapter.ts) and set:

# AI_EXTRACTION_PROVIDER=openai
# AI_EXTRACTION_API_KEY=your-real-api-key-here

# These are read ONLY on the server (inside Next.js API routes). They are
# never sent to the browser and must never be committed to source control.
